WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.620
- I've been in jail all,
damn near all my life.

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:03.730
I aint never been a coward.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.050
I aint never been a PC.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.640
I aint never worked with the police.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:07.970
And I aint never went on the other side

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.410
of the field and gave shit up.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.850
I walk my walk whatever time I had to do,

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.170
I served it.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:17.620
I didn't cross the line and
give the police no information,

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.550
in order for me to be a better person,

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.610
in order for me to be
able to walk that walk.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.990
I walked it because I had time to do.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.133
I don't share bread with the officers.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.993
I don't do that.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.660
I know my responsibility.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.120
And I know my obligations.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.560
I know my priorities.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.700
And I know my, I know
my rules that I follow,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.720
and I don't break 'em for nobody.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.550
If I tell you my word is good,
that's where I stand behind.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.723
I don't make promises that I can't keep.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.950
But I stand behind
everything that I tell you.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.100
I'm not a buster.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.980
I'm not a mark.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.780
I'm not a bitch.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.060
I'm a soldier that stands on
the front line of this shit.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.940
And like I said again, I
ain't afraid of nothing.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.030
You can send your best buddy at me.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.720
He can be King Kong son,

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:04.940
I'll take his ass on.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.090
And if he whoop me,

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.763
at least I know I took him on.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:12.090
That's how I stand, man, you know.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.860
I stand in these streets now.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.010
And I'm not afraid to walk these streets,

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.930
and you have to be strong
in order to walk because

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.100
you see so much shit goes on at night

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:25.130
you'd be surprised to see that
your heart is still pumping.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.570
That's how scary some of the
shit that you have to live

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:31.580
with out here and keep
going and keep your mother,

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:33.960
keep your motherfucking mouth shut.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.903
And just go.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.820
Let yo day be yo day.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:40.270
And don't let it be the
things that you spilled out

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.770
and told the wrong person.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:45.063
Because if you do, you might
not live to see the next one.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:50.060
So watch what you say.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.309
Certain things you can't say

00:01:51.309 --> 00:01:53.259
and there's certain things you can say.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:55.930
That's the truth, dog.

00:02:12.891 --> 00:02:15.224
I just burning up right now.

